#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/1-topic_based.md:1
#: 0d753071c85b440881388c7348a87594
msgid "topic_based_ros2_control"
msgstr "topic_based_ros2_control"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/1-topic_based.md:3
#: 80e3418c33f14850a71e223ed8dae577
msgid ""
"In-tree under `arms_ros2_control/hardwares/` (not a nested gitmodule). "
"ROS 2 topic hardware interface used when `hardware:=isaac`."
msgstr ""
"位于 `arms_ros2_control/hardwares/` 树内（不是嵌套 git 子模块）。`hardware:=isaac` 时使用的"
" ROS 2 话题驱动层。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/1-topic_based.md:5
#: 17abfcb1ca8944c18fef878cdc4424a4
msgid ""
"The plugin defaults below (`/robot_joint_commands`, "
"`/robot_joint_states`) are the class defaults in the README. The shared "
"description macro [`simulation_hardware.xacro`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-sim/robot-descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/xacro/ros2_control/simulation_hardware.xacro)"
" overrides them to `/isaac/joint_command` and `/isaac/joint_states` "
"(Acone uses that macro). W2’s topic-bridge USD uses `/joint_command` and "
"`/joint_states` instead. The xacro `<param>` and the OmniGraph "
"`topicName` are the same strings. In-process Isaac (`hardware=isaac_sim`)"
" does not use this plugin."
msgstr ""
"下面的插件默认值（`/robot_joint_commands`、`/robot_joint_states`）是 README "
"里的类默认值。共享描述宏 [`simulation_hardware.xacro`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/robot-descriptions-"
"common/blob/main/robot_common_launch/xacro/ros2_control/simulation_hardware.xacro)"
" 把它们改成 `/isaac/joint_command` 和 `/isaac/joint_states`（Acone 用这个宏）。W2 的话题桥"
" USD 用的是 `/joint_command` 和 `/joint_states`。xacro 的 `<param>` 与 OmniGraph"
" 的 `topicName` 是同一组字符串。进程内 Isaac（`hardware=isaac_sim`）不用这个插件。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/1-topic_based.md:7
#: 154875e98962412db18fe2aea616f15f
msgid ""
"**Plugin:** `topic_based_ros2_control/TopicBasedSystem`. No "
"`declare_parameter` and no `on_set_parameters`."
msgstr ""
"**插件：** `topic_based_ros2_control/TopicBasedSystem`。无 "
"`declare_parameter`，也无 `on_set_parameters`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/1-topic_based.md:9
#: bf6ab8d07cd94c3ca741c76f5913adb1
msgid ""
"**README:** [topic_based_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/d50933d6862ad35ec7633ef522a134924827b115/hardwares/topic_based_ros2_control/README.md)."
" Source: [`topic_based_system.cpp`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/d50933d6862ad35ec7633ef522a134924827b115/hardwares/topic_based_ros2_control/src/topic_based_system.cpp)"
" at [`d50933d`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/tree/d50933d6862ad35ec7633ef522a134924827b115)."
msgstr ""
"**README：** [topic_based_ros2_control](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/d50933d6862ad35ec7633ef522a134924827b115/hardwares/topic_based_ros2_control/README.md)。源码：[`topic_based_system.cpp`](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/blob/d50933d6862ad35ec7633ef522a134924827b115/hardwares/topic_based_ros2_control/src/topic_based_system.cpp)，提交"
" [`d50933d`](https://github.com/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/tree/d50933d6862ad35ec7633ef522a134924827b115)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/1-topic_based.md:11
#: 2f6ebd835cbf492f852dbcbaec885aaa
msgid ""
"How to read **Startup only** / **Runtime**: [Hardware "
"Interfaces](0-index.md). Isaac Sim: [Isaac "
"Sim](../../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md)."
msgstr ""
"如何读 **仅启动** / **运行时**：[驱动层](0-index.md)。Isaac Sim：[Isaac "
"Sim](../../2-how_to/2-simulation/4-isaac_sim.md)。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/1-topic_based.md:13
#: a2d4bbe6471147919a1c8bc13262bcd9
msgid ""
"<ros2_control name=\"my_system\" type=\"system\">\n"
"  <hardware>\n"
"    <plugin>topic_based_ros2_control/TopicBasedSystem</plugin>\n"
"    <param name=\"joint_commands_topic\">/robot_joint_commands</param>\n"
"    <param name=\"joint_states_topic\">/robot_joint_states</param>\n"
"    <param name=\"initialize_commands_from_state\">true</param>\n"
"  </hardware>\n"
"</ros2_control>"
msgstr ""
"<ros2_control name=\"my_system\" type=\"system\">\n"
"  <hardware>\n"
"    <plugin>topic_based_ros2_control/TopicBasedSystem</plugin>\n"
"    <param name=\"joint_commands_topic\">/robot_joint_commands</param>\n"
"    <param name=\"joint_states_topic\">/robot_joint_states</param>\n"
"    <param name=\"initialize_commands_from_state\">true</param>\n"
"  </hardware>\n"
"</ros2_control>"

